    "8-bit bytes, 32-bit uint and 32-bit int",
    "Counts <= 1 perform no accesses and permit a null pointer.",
    "For 2 <= N <= INT_MAX/2, param_1 points to index N of one initialized live uint array with at least 2*N elements.",
    "The N-element guard prefix exists to make unchanged decrement pointer formation defined; it is never read or written.",
    "The logical N-element range is writable and contains no volatile or concurrently modified memory.",
